Dialogue: 3,0:04:43.30,0:04:44.80,NSigns,,0,0,0,,{\pos(342,536)\fnBradley Hand ITC\fsp1\fs122\blur0.7\c&H767273&}O que você\Nquis dizer\Ncom isso?!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:43.30,0:04:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,O que você quis dizer com isso?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:44.81,0:04:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,E-Ei... Tudo bem.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:47.94,0:04:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu pretendia fazer sozinha, por isso...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:50.18,0:04:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos ajudar.\N Fomos longe demais para voltar.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:53.15,0:04:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Bem, não vai adiantar muita \N coisa perguntar às pessoas,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:56.52,0:05:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,e eu tenho a sensação de que \N levaria muito tempo também.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:00.57,0:05:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:02.34,0:05:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Ei, Iroha-chan.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:04.15,0:05:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Se pretende procurar por Kamihama, tome.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:09.22,0:05:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Quando sentir fome, pode \N ser boa ideia passar aqui.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.70,0:05:14.71,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1033.6,474.4)\fs150\fnKG Primary Italics\c&HAC3370&\frz16.3\b1\blur1.5\be1}Mitama
Dialogue: 10,0:05:13.90,0:05:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Entendi! Então você é uma \N Garota Mágica também, é?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:17.33,0:05:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Fico feliz de ter vindo aqui \N depois de ver o panfleto.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:20.71,0:05:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, vinda direto do Restaurante Chinês \N Banbanzai, eu sou a Garota Mágica mais forte:
Dialogue: 10,0:05:26.09,0:05:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yui Tsuruno!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:27.50,0:05:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Prazer!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:29.96,0:05:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu sou Tamaki Iroha.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:32.35,0:05:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, eu só pedi lámen...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:34.77,0:05:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,São cortesias para Garotas Mágicas!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.77,0:05:36.48,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(938,103.8)\blur5\clip(637,88,1239,93)\fs50\fnA-OTF Kanteiryu Std Ultra\b1\fscx71\fscy86\c&H1319D6&\alpha&HC0&}Oferecemos Cortesias a Garotas Mágicas!
