Dialogue: 10,0:05:37.08,0:05:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,E são todas porções grandes.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:38.61,0:05:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Não, não. \N São as porções normais.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:41.93,0:05:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Normais...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:42.94,0:05:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Anda, come!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:45.32,0:05:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Muito obrigada.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:47.22,0:05:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Então...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:49.31,0:05:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Obrigada pela—
Dialogue: 10,0:05:50.99,0:05:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Não precisa se acanhar.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:58.23,0:06:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,E? O que achou?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:06.93,0:06:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Está gostoso.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:09.05,0:06:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Qual nota você daria?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:10.91,0:06:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Está gostoso.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:12.32,0:06:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Qual nota? Qual nota?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:14.29,0:06:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Uma nota...?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:15.93,0:06:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Transforme esse sentimento \N honesto num valor numérico! Vai!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:19.10,0:06:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Bem, dar um número seria meio...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:23.11,0:06:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Qual nota você dá para essa comida?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:25.35,0:06:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,30... Não, 50?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:28.78,0:06:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Só 50?!
