Dialogue: 10,0:07:49.28,0:07:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Oi, há quanto tempo.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:54.35,0:07:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Tenho um favorzinho para pedir.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:57.38,0:08:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Tem uma garota aqui que quer investigar boatos.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:00.98,0:08:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,O quê? Sério?!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:03.42,0:08:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Está tudo bem mesmo?!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:06.36,0:08:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Iroha-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:07.21,0:08:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela quer se encontrar conosco agora!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:16.50,0:08:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Mestra Yachiyo!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:19.86,0:08:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Era você? É sobre sua irmã de novo?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:25.16,0:08:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Desculpe, mas...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:26.17,0:08:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,N-Não vá embora!
