Dialogue: 10,0:16:21.58,0:16:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim. Isso mesmo.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:23.95,0:16:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Era algo tão importante, \N mas não percebi até agora...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:27.47,0:16:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yachiyo?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:28.46,0:16:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Tsuruno! Tamaki-san!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:30.73,0:16:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim?!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:31.98,0:16:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Podem me ajudar?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:33.13,0:16:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim!
