Dialogue: 10,0:20:44.76,0:20:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Agora, rezamos.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:53.13,0:20:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Não vai escrever nada? Não vai?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:55.51,0:20:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Você não quer encontrar ninguém?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:59.51,0:21:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Iroha-chan! Vá na frente!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:02.03,0:21:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:03.15,0:21:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu sou a mais forte, então ficarei bem!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:05.35,0:21:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Cuide da Mestra!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:27.46,0:21:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Por favor, Deus.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:29.49,0:21:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Me deixe ver a Ui.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:42.20,0:21:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yachiyo-san, aqui é...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:48.27,0:21:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Mifuyu.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:52.27,0:21:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Ui... É você?
